Summary of Major Modifications:
- Added resilient auto-recovery supervisor and watchdog (gnirehtet_watchdog.py, run_watchdog.cmd, run_watchdog.sh).
- Added dynamic discovery of Java and ADB binaries across platforms without hardcoded paths.
- Added automatic provisioning and installation of gnirehtet.apk on newly connected devices.
- Added low-latency ZGC memory optimizations for modern JVMs (Java 15+).
- Added VRChat OSC disconnect notice handling in Java relay server.
- Modernized relay-java build system with Gradle 9.1 and Java 21/25 compilation support.
- Streamlined project structure to focus on the high-performance Java relay server.
